  "summary": "Malicious code in @or-sdk/card-templates (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall hook (setup.mjs) downloads the Bun runtime from github[.]com/oven-sh/bun and executes a bundled 727KB obfuscated script (math_init.js) at install time. The script uses a custom string-array decoder and base-N encoding to hide its logic. A card-templates library has no legitimate reason to download a runtime and run a large obfuscated payload during installation; the payload's behaviour is concealed by the obfuscation.",
